# hypernix.blender

4-tier multi-source mixing: HandBlender / PersonalBlender / CountertopBlender / HighPowerBlender.

## Documentation pages

- [Blender](../../#/docs/Blender) · [MDXL source](pages/Blender.mdxl)

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `HandBlender()`

Straight concatenation. Source A, then source B, then C, …

### `PersonalBlender()`

Round-robin interleave. Pulls one line from each source in

### `CountertopBlender()`

Weighted random sampling with replacement.

### `HighPowerBlender()`

Buffers every source into RAM, concatenates, then shuffles.

### `blender(tier, sources, **kw)`

Construct a blender tier by name.

